  "title": "Sweet Potato Surprise",
  "description": "The surprising ingredient in this casserole are the bananas which are blended into the sweet potatoes. Bake topped with miniature marshmallows and flaked coconut.",
  "authors": [
    "Debbie Rowe"
  ],
  "date_published": "1998-11-09T22:12:15-05:00",
